Sales Dashboard Summary – Power BI
The Sales Dashboard provides a comprehensive overview of key sales performance metrics, enabling effective data-driven 
decision-making. The dashboard is designed with interactive features and visual elements to enhance user experience and data 
analysis efficiency. Key components include:
•	Slicers: Multiple slicers are used to filter data dynamically by parameters such as Supervisor, enabling focused and granular 
analysis across different dimensions.
•	Pie Chart: Visualizes Total Sales by Brand, providing a clear comparison of brand-wise sales contributions.
•	Column Chart: Displays Quantity Sold by Category, offering insights into product category performance and inventory movement.
•	KPI Cards: Highlight critical performance indicators, including:
o	Total Sales
o	Total Cost
o	Total Quantity
o	Number of Transactions
o	Net Sales
